\u00e1rio e g\u00e9nero, a prova de 10 km atribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 5 primeiros da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral masculina e feminina: 200 \u20ac (1\u00ba), 150 \u20ac (2\u00ba), 100 \u20ac (3\u00ba), 50 \u20ac (4\u00ba) e 20 \u20ac (5\u00ba).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Flor 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Avenida Marechal Carmona (em frente ao Edif\u00edcio Municipal), Vila Flor\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Flor\", \"addressRegion\": \"Bragan\u00e7a\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Flor 2026 realiza-se a 12 de dezembro em Vila Flor (Bragan\u00e7a), com Corrida de 10 km e Kids 500 m. Consulta o regulamento e inscri\u00e7\u00f5es!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-sao-silvestre-de-vila-flor.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km (Sub-20, Seniores e Veteranos)\", \"price\": \"8.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/3-corrida-sao-silvestre-vila-flor\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre Kids 500 m (Benjamins A Sub-10 e Benjamins B Sub-12)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/3-corrida-sao-silvestre-vila-flor\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Flor e Clube Azenhas Vivas - Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Campismo e 